Package: kulan-base
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Pre-Depends: dpkg (>= 1.19.1)
Depends: ufw, unattended-upgrades
Recommends: apparmor-profiles-extra, systemd-zram-generator, systemd-oomd
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ identity, update channel and security defaults
 Makes the system identify as @NAME@ (Settings > About, os-release), adds
 the @NAME@ software update channel, and sets security and privacy
 defaults: firewall on, automatic security updates, Wi-Fi address
 randomization and private Firefox defaults.
